<body>
<header class="top"><div class="brand">RM · GIS / SURVEY / 3D</div><div class="tools"><button class="btnx primary" id="drawBtn">Draw plot</button><button class="btnx" id="finishBtn">Finish</button><button class="btnx" id="clearBtn">Clear</button><button class="btnx" id="exportBtn">Export GeoJSON</button><a class="btnx text-decoration-none" href="index.php">AI Planner</a></div></header>
<div class="workspace">
<aside class="side">
<div class="panel"><h6>Survey workspace</h6><div class="metric" id="area">0.00 m²</div><div class="muted">Live polygon area</div><hr><div class="metric" id="perimeter">0.00 m</div><div class="muted">Perimeter</div></div>
<div class="panel"><h6>Technology layer</h6><div class="feature-card"><strong>C++</strong><span class="muted">3D geometry, rendering and high-performance spatial engine.</span></div><div class="feature-card"><strong>Python</strong><span class="muted">GIS, AI, automation, geometry and engineering calculations.</span></div><div class="feature-card"><strong>TypeScript / JavaScript</strong><span class="muted">Browser map, CAD-style interaction and application UI.</span></div><div class="feature-card"><strong>PostgreSQL + PostGIS</strong><span class="muted">Target spatial database for coordinates, parcels, roads and buildings.</span></div><div class="feature-card"><strong>WebGL / WebGPU</strong><span class="muted">Browser GPU layer for interactive 2D/3D visualization.</span></div><div class="feature-card"><strong>OpenGL / Vulkan</strong><span class="muted">Future native high-performance rendering engine.</span></div></div>
<div class="panel"><h6>Survey points</h6><table class="table-mini"><tbody id="points"><tr><td colspan="3" class="muted">Click Draw plot, then click the map.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</aside>
<main class="map"><div id="map" class="mapbox"></div><div class="map-hint"><b id="modeText">Map ready.</b><br><span>Draw plot → click boundary points → Finish. Double-click also finishes.</span></div></main>
<aside class="side right">
<div class="panel"><h6>Map data</h6><div class="status" id="mapStatus">OpenStreetMap base map · MapLibre WebGL</div><div class="mt-2 coord" id="cursor">Move over map for coordinates.</div></div>
<div class="panel"><h6>3D / GPU</h6><div class="status" id="gpuStatus">Checking WebGPU…</div><div class="muted mt-2">The map renderer uses WebGL now. WebGPU capability is detected for the next high-performance 3D engine layer.</div></div>
<div class="panel"><h6>Plot geometry</h6><canvas id="plan2d" class="canvas2d" width="600" height="300"></canvas><div class="muted mt-2">This preview is generated from the same surveyed polygon. It is the foundation for connecting the AI house plan to the real site.</div></div>
<div class="panel"><h6>Next engineering layers</h6><div class="legend"><span class="dot"></span> Plot / parcel</div><div class="legend"><span class="dot blue"></span> Building footprint</div><div class="legend"><span class="dot gold"></span> Survey / control point</div><div class="footer-note">Preliminary GIS/survey visualization only. Professional boundary survey, structural design and construction documents require qualified professionals.</div></div>
</aside>
